        <p class="section-head__lede mx-auto lg:mx-0">Every Animalife formulation is screened for Naturally Occurring Prohibited Substances (NOPS) and Herbal, Spice &amp; Plant Substance (HSPS) contamination through our CleanSport+ Programme&mdash;giving owners, trainers, and riders complete confidence on competition day.</p>
        <a href="/about/difference" class="btn-outline mt-8 bg-white">Learn About CleanSport+</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

